{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29052","headline":"移摄太平寄前李明府 · 许浑","name":"移摄太平寄前李明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病移岩邑称闲身，何处风光贳酒频。\n溪柳遶门彭泽令，野花连洞武陵人。\n娇歌自驻壶中景，艳舞长留海上春。\n早晚高台更同醉，绿萝如帐草如茵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29052.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29052","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}